{"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/pulls/142381", "id": 4946707328, "node_id": "PR_kwDOPRF1G88AAAABJtjDgA", "html_url": "https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent/pull/142381", "diff_url": "https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent/pull/142381.diff", "patch_url": "https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent/pull/142381.patch", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/142381", "commits_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/pulls/142381/commits", "review_comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/pulls/142381/comments", "review_comment_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/pulls/comments{/number}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/142381/comments", "statuses_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/statuses/281433acd758a06047a7a1a3b1d220bc46741a35", "number": 142381, "state": "open", "locked": false, "title": "feat(plugin-catalog): add skill-lineage", "user": {"login": "simin-yuan", "id": 281164480, "node_id": "U_kgDOEMI6wA", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/281164480?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/simin-yuan", "html_url": "https://github.com/simin-yuan", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/simin-yuan/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/simin-yuan/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/simin-yuan/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/simin-yuan/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/simin-yuan/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/simin-yuan/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/simin-yuan/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/simin-yuan/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/simin-yuan/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "body": "## What it does\n\nRecords where each skill version's content came from, and keeps that record\nverifiable afterwards.\n\nFor every skill write — a foreground `skill_manage` call, a background-review\nedit, or a curator consolidation — the plugin stores the content fingerprint\nbefore and after, the sources present earlier in the same session (user text,\ntool results, skills that were read), the features that link a source to the\nadded lines, and a `seq -> prev_hash -> hash` chain over the entries. Text is\nnever stored; hashes are keyed per install and the key stays in\n`plugin-data/skill-lineage`.\n\n`hermes skill-lineage trace <skill>` / `descendants <url|skill>` / `report` /\n`verify` / `head` answer where a version came from, what a source produced,\nwhich versions carry lines of no traceable origin, and whether the chain (or a\nrecorded head value) still matches. A key reset is recorded in the chain and\nshown in `status` rather than happening silently.\n\n## Hermes surfaces used\n\nFour hooks, all read-only observers: `on_session_start`, `pre_llm_call`,\n`pre_tool_call`, `post_tool_call`. One CLI command group\n(`hermes skill-lineage ...`). No tools, no middleware, no env vars, no core\noverride. Capabilities in the entry match what the pinned commit registers.\n\n## Disclosure (rule 13)\n\nReads tool results, user messages and skill files to compute keyed hashes.\nStores hashes (never text) for 7 days per session, plus the lineage chain\n(hashes and skill names) under `plugin-data/skill-lineage`. No network calls, no\ncredentials, never blocks or changes a tool call.\n\n## Tests\n\n`python -m pytest -q` on the pinned commit (Hermes `e06df9c2ea`, Python 3.11.16\nand 3.14.7): 46 passed, 1 skipped. `hermes plugins validate .`: passes, no\nwarnings. The skip is the end-to-end suite, which needs a Hermes importable by\nthe running interpreter and skips with a printed reason rather than passing\nsilently.\n\nManual end-to-end smoke run on Hermes `e06df9c2ea` (2026-10-21): installed into\nan isolated `HERMES_HOME`, enabled, and driven by one real session that created\na skill through `skill_manage`; `status`, `trace`, `descendants`, `report`,\n`verify` and `head` all returned as documented. Raw output in\n[tests/smoke-2026-10-21.txt](https://github.com/simin-yuan/hermes-skill-lineage/blob/main/tests/smoke-2026-10-21.txt).\n\n## Relation to existing work\n\n- #139096 asks for read-back of *installed-skill provenance* (source URL,\n  revision, files, install path). That is where a skill came **from at install\n  time**; this records which session evidence a skill version's **content was\n  derived from**. Complementary, not overlapping.\n- `skill-integrity` (catalog) detects that installed skill files **changed**.\n  This records **origin**: which source, which lines, whether the record is\n  intact. A drift detector and an origin record answer different questions.\n- No private core imports: the skill lookup scans `$HERMES_HOME/skills` instead\n  of importing `tools.skills_tool` (rule 9).\n\nOwner submission (rule 5): I am the repository owner.", "labels": [{"id": 8987445155, "node_id": "LA_kwDOPRF1G88AAAACF7GHow", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/labels/type/feature", "name": "type/feature", "description": "New feature or request", "color": "a2eeef", "default": false, "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 10753084711, "node_id": "LA_kwDOPRF1G88AAAACgO8NJw", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/labels/comp/plugins", "name": "comp/plugins", "description": "Plugin system and bundled plugins", "color": "6f42c1", "default": false, "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 10753091728, "node_id": "LA_kwDOPRF1G88AAAACgO8okA", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/labels/P3", "name": "P3", "description": "Low — cosmetic, nice to have", "color": "0E8A16", "default": false, "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}], "milestone": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "created_at": "2026-10-21T05:08:14Z", "updated_at": "2026-10-21T09:29:38Z", "closed_at": null, "merged_at": null, "merge_commit_sha": "a44cc8b0ca1d7d0953ac7558f209fdb7cd123aad", "assignee": null, "assignees": [], "requested_reviewers": [], "requested_teams": [], "head": {"label": "simin-yuan:catalog/skill-lineage", "ref": "catalog/skill-lineage", "repo": {"id": 1424649272, "node_id": "R_kgDOVOpsOA", "name": "hermes-agent", "full_name": "simin-yuan/hermes-agent", "owner": {"login": "simin-yuan", "id": 281164480, "node_id": "U_kgDOEMI6wA", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/281164480?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/simin-yuan", "html_url": "https://github.com/simin-yuan", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/simin-yuan/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/simin-yuan/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/simin-yuan/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/simin-yuan/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/simin-yuan/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/simin-yuan/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/simin-yuan/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/simin-yuan/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/simin-yuan/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "private": false, "fork": true, "archived": false, "disabled": false, "description": "The agent that grows with you", "homepage": "https://hermes-agent.nousresearch.com", "language": "Python", "visibility": "public", "is_template": false, "topics": [], "forks_count": 0, "forks": 0, "stargazers_count": 1, "watchers_count": 1, "watchers": 1, "open_issues_count": 0, "open_issues": 0, "size": 1291754, "default_branch": "m